/**
 * The colour a run keeps once its ending reached the thread.
 *
 * The comment heals the thread, and the run's colour then has to carry what the
 * comment cannot. Two shapes are green: a step that came back — every ordinary run
 * and every soft stop — and an agent failure whose notice landed, which has said
